usage: AC.py [-h] [--lr LR] [--gamma GAMMA] [--hidden_dim HIDDEN_DIM] [--num_episodes NUM_EPISODES] [--no_cuda NO_CUDA] [--advantage ADVANTAGE] [--seed SEED]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --lr LR               Learning Rate
  --gamma GAMMA         Discount Factor
  --hidden_dim HIDDEN_DIM
                        Hidden Layers of the network
  --num_episodes NUM_EPISODES
                        Number of Episodes to train on
  --no_cuda NO_CUDA     Set to true if not using cuda (when available)
  --advantage ADVANTAGE
                        Set to true if using A2C
  --seed SEED           Set a seed for reproducibility


usage: reinforce.py [-h] [--lr LR] [--gamma GAMMA] [--hidden_dim HIDDEN_DIM] [--num_episodes NUM_EPISODES] [--no_cuda NO_CUDA] [--seed SEED]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --lr LR               Learning Rate
  --gamma GAMMA         Discount Factor
  --hidden_dim HIDDEN_DIM
                        Size of hidden layer in network
  --num_episodes NUM_EPISODES
                        Number of Episodes to train on
  --no_cuda NO_CUDA     Set to true if not using cuda (when available)
  --seed SEED           Set a seed for reproducibility